<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1721450054"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:27.147"><div begin="30.499" end="1:12.359" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="30.499" end="37.569" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.499" end="31.891">我在阴</span><span begin="31.891" end="32.131">暗</span><span begin="32.131" end="32.842">中</span><span begin="32.842" end="33.090">降</span><span begin="33.090" end="33.726">落</span> <span begin="34.015" end="34.823">世</span><span begin="34.823" end="35.590">界在</span><span begin="35.590" end="36.155">雨中</span><span begin="36.155" end="37.569">淹没</span></p><p begin="37.864" end="44.932" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.864" end="38.561">画</span><span begin="38.561" end="39.479">面与现</span><span begin="39.479" end="40.179">实</span><span begin="40.179" end="40.429">交</span><span begin="40.429" end="42.106">错</span> <span begin="42.282" end="42.917">无法</span><span begin="42.917" end="43.785">抽离卡在</span><span begin="43.785" end="44.932">胸口</span></p><p begin="45.238" end="52.544" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.238" end="45.969">躯</span><span begin="45.969" end="46.848">壳如行</span><span begin="46.848" end="47.587">尸</span><span begin="47.587" end="47.838">走</span><span begin="47.838" end="48.647">肉</span> <span begin="48.883" end="49.581">陷</span><span begin="49.581" end="50.600">阱漩涡</span><span begin="50.600" end="51.058">我</span><span begin="51.058" end="51.698">已受</span><span begin="51.698" end="52.544">够</span></p><p begin="52.614" end="58.622" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.614" end="53.305">挣</span><span begin="53.305" end="54.303">脱逃离</span><span begin="54.303" end="55.015">这</span><span begin="55.015" end="55.685">个空</span><span begin="55.685" end="58.622">洞</span></p><p begin="58.632" end="1:06.770" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.632" end="59.277">如果</span> <span begin="59.490" end="1:00.967">我冲出</span><span begin="1:00.967" end="1:02.581">黑幕笼罩</span><span begin="1:02.581" end="1:04.186">的</span><span begin="1:04.186" end="1:04.428">天</span><span begin="1:04.428" end="1:06.770">空</span></p><p begin="1:06.906" end="1:12.359" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.906" end="1:08.244">就别再</span><span begin="1:08.244" end="1:09.942">捆绑我的</span><span begin="1:09.942" end="1:10.422">自</span><span begin="1:10.422" end="1:12.359">由</span></p></div><div begin="1:12.443" end="1:48.215" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:12.443" end="1:20.005" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.443" end="1:13.643">在狂风</span><span begin="1:13.643" end="1:14.056">之</span><span begin="1:14.056" end="1:15.406">中</span> <span begin="1:15.616" end="1:17.102">嘶吼</span> <span begin="1:17.296" end="1:18.916">作困兽之</span><span begin="1:18.916" end="1:20.005">斗</span></p><p begin="1:20.075" end="1:27.000" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.075" end="1:20.312">我</span><span begin="1:20.312" end="1:20.752">奋</span><span begin="1:20.752" end="1:20.998">力</span><span begin="1:20.998" end="1:21.475">冲</span><span begin="1:21.475" end="1:22.475">破</span> <span begin="1:22.579" end="1:27.000">封闭的思绪震开裂缝</span></p><p begin="1:27.233" end="1:34.759" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.233" end="1:28.206">燃烧</span><span begin="1:28.206" end="1:28.915">的花</span><span begin="1:28.915" end="1:29.833">朵</span> <span begin="1:30.349" end="1:31.836">升空</span> <span begin="1:32.088" end="1:33.701">消失在空</span><span begin="1:33.701" end="1:34.759">中</span></p><p begin="1:34.820" end="1:40.992" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.820" end="1:35.825">记忆在</span><span begin="1:35.825" end="1:37.245">剥落</span> <span begin="1:37.375" end="1:39.924">残留的影像轮</span><span begin="1:39.924" end="1:40.992">廓</span></p><p begin="1:41.154" end="1:48.215" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.154" end="1:42.916">溃散在薄</span><span begin="1:42.916" end="1:43.806">雾</span><span begin="1:43.806" end="1:48.215">中</span></p></div><div